Tools and dependencies the skill assumes
---------------------------------------
v2 uses Node + Playwright (Apache 2.0), FFmpeg and Python + numpy (BSD). GSAP and HyperFrames
below apply only to the v1 scripts in legacy/. None of these are bundled here; you install them yourself and they carry their own terms.

  - GSAP — GreenSock. Free for the great majority of uses under the GSAP Standard "No
    Charge" licence (https://gsap.com/licensing/), but read it before you ship: the terms
    turn on how your project is monetised, not on how you use the library. The docs here
    tell you to vendor gsap.min.js into your own project; that copy is GreenSock's, under
    GreenSock's terms, not this repository's.
  - HyperFrames — https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes, the default renderer.
  - FFmpeg — required at runtime by four of the scripts; check its licensing if you
    redistribute a build (LGPL or GPL depending on how it was configured).
  - Node.js — MIT.

